es the Jewel-bilee to steal all of the jewels.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kdV5FXaqqg1Lvevz0vUnOHlPzP9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-20\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Mal-lone\",\"overview\":\"Mal and Evie rush to help their friends, only to discover the AKs are unwilling to work together with the VKs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fyFON7sdH7CS2g3nD45BR3Ov9ZC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-27\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Trapped\",\"overview\":\"A pint-sized Jay, Carlos, Freddie and Jane try to escape the genie lamp that Jordan has them trapped inside.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/keMy57GY8RNeqsbbHPy5I74fBeN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-03\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Face to Face\",\"overview\":\"Mal and Evie face off against Zevon as he uses the stolen Jewel-bilee gems to take over all of Auradon.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3RxnzWlRVnF5UWkeTbGuFiRmifm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-10\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"United We Stand\",\"overview\":\"AKs to the rescue. Audrey, Lonnie, Ally, Jordan, and Ben join together with Mal and Evie in their battle against Zevon.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/849f7VgqFsrq2zJNUO46jXJkb8c.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-17\",\"runtime\":4},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Celebration\",\"overview\":\"As Mal, Evie, Carlos, Jay, and Freddie are bestowed their Jewels at the Jewel-bilee, all the AK’s and VK’s agree that they really are better when they’re working together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gax408tub0QHt4wp3bFjNsjkbC3.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-24\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-03\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":17,